; `chain` in a proof block is rejected like `use` (it is transitivity axioms) -- with its own
; message, not the one of the generated `use` in a pseudo-file (soundness review of 2026-09-29)
load prop
; (in a helper file: inside `expect`, whose content is discarded, `chain` is allowed)
expect "EvalError" "`chain` is not allowed inside `assume` -- declare it before the proof"
    load "helpers/chain-in-assume.kurt"
